'''Abiphones & Co.''' is a large, tall location in the {{zone|Village}}. Home to {{NPCSprite|Alda}} and {{NPCSprite|Karis}}, it serves as a place for players to purchase an [[Abiphone]].

{{ZoneText
|Learn about &3Abiphones &ffrom &6Alda&f.
|Purchase your first &3Abiphone&f!
}}

== Purpose ==
'''Abiphones & Co.''' is home to {{NPCSprite|Alda}}, an [[NPC]] who introduces the player to [[Abiphones]] and sells the {{Item|Abiphone Basic}} for {{Coins|100,000}}. Both the {{Item|Abiphone Basic}} and {{Item|Abiphone Contacts Trio}} are displayed and prompt the player to talk to {{NPCSprite|Alda}} and {{NPCSprite|Elizabeth}} when interacting with them.

